# Python and Blender leftovers
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.blend1
*.blend@

# Art previews: keep the art director's renders, the Studio look-check shots and each set's lineup image.
# Everything else is a render output; regenerate it with the review scripts in art/blender (see art/README.md).
art/previews/**/tiles/
art/previews/_ArtDirection/_sheet_*
art/previews/Arms/*
art/previews/Buildings/*
art/previews/Foliage/*
art/previews/Items/*
art/previews/Landmarks/*
art/previews/Props/*
art/previews/Rocks/*
art/previews/BuildingsReal/*
art/previews/GroundReal/*
art/previews/ItemsReal/*
art/previews/LandmarksReal/*
art/previews/TreesReal/*
!art/previews/*/_lineup*.png

# Style test: keep the comparison sheet and one lineup per style; the rest regenerates from
# art/blender/style_*.py (Blender renders) or the Workspace.StyleTest diorama (Studio captures).
art/previews/StyleTest/A/*
art/previews/StyleTest/B/*
art/previews/StyleTest/C/*
art/previews/StyleTest/Studio/*
!art/previews/StyleTest/A/A_lineup_midday.png
!art/previews/StyleTest/B/_B_overview.png
!art/previews/StyleTest/C/lineup_midday.png
